<title>SWEDEN: Sydkraft posts H1 profit 1.33 bln SKR.</title>
<headline>Sydkraft posts H1 profit 1.33 bln SKR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish power group Sydkraft reports for the six months ended June 30, 1996, compared to a year earlier.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		 1,331  vs   1,321</p>
<p> Turnover				   7,021  vs   6,225</p>
<p> Operating costs			  4,620  vs   3,737</p>
<p> Depreciation				 651  vs     626</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	1,750  vs   1,862</p>
<p> Financial income			   151  vs     142</p>
<p> Financial costs			    611  vs     712</p>
<p> Minorities				     9  vs	10</p>
<p> Tax					    363  vs     381</p>
<p> Net profit				   959  vs     930</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share (crowns)	   5.02  vs    4.87</p>
<p>NOTE -- Sydkraft AB is a Swedish power group.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
